	(text_box "At VCC=2.5, \n-  f_clk_max = 3.2MHz\n-  t_pd = 80-190ns\n\nAt VCC=2.5, \n-  f_clk_max = 13MHz\n-  t_pd = 20-38ns\n\nVCC=3.3V is not specced\n\nAt f_clk = 12.288MHz, each bit period is 81MHz\n\nPCM5100 DS specifies no MCLK / LRCLK phase synchronization is needed\n\nLikely need to run VCC at higher voltage to meet specification\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 149.86 44.45 0)
		(size -60.96 35.56)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 242 204 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "01137dc8-ad2a-442e-9dda-edc697ad0179")
	)
	(text_box "LRCLK transitions occur on falling BCLK edge.  \n\nAssume:\nBCLK is bit[1]\nLRCLK is bit[6]\n\nWhen LRCLK is set, count will be at 0x01000000\nThe previous count will be 0x00111111\n\nTherefore, when LRCLK transitionsHIGH, BCLK will transition LOW\n\nInverter fixes this.  LRCLK being inverted doesn't since all downstream devices won't know any different\n\nMCLK/LRCLK phase relationship doesn't matter according to PCM5100 DS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 269.24 138.43 0)
		(size -71.12 38.1)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 242 204 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "52678656-f9a6-463c-8705-26e7e2a6f6d0")
	)
	(text_box "Use MCLK to generate I2S BCLK and LRCLK.\n\nManually creating LRCLK and BCLK ensures they will always be in phase with eachother and allows for slight MCLK variation/adjsutment"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 248.92 34.29 0)
		(size -78.74 17.78)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 242 204 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(thickness 0.3556)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5f5e45aa-552d-4281-b8f1-fd01cc335322")
	)
	(text_box "Use @{\"Id\":\"GRCFOQZ~{N}BQQCUJHD\",\"ObjectType\":2} to jump to GND if using a TCXO instead where no control is needed"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 173.99 0)
